{
  "file": "module2",
  "page": 24,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.420166015625,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "recommendation needs to be assessed in each setting, and there is a need to prioritize screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        224.4709930419922,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "across risk groups in each setting.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        102.29462432861328,
        527.4188842773438,
        116.73762512207031
      ],
      "text": "For TB screening recommendations across all populations and in all settings, all people identified",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.384765625,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "with presumptive TB disease should be offered HIV counselling and testing. In settings with a high",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        125.90058898925781,
        527.4215698242188,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "(8) prevalence of HIV, counselling and testing for HIV may be offered to all people screened for TB  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.3882446289062,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "People identified through screening who have symptoms or abnormalities suggestive of TB but who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.395751953125,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "are not diagnosed with TB disease should be counselled and supported to seek medical care if their",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.2509765625,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "symptoms continue, emerge, re-emerge or worsen. If possible, repeat testing for TB should be offered",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968053817749023,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        164.1131134033203,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "to these individuals.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.19862365722656,
        527.4234008789062,
        217.64161682128906
      ],
      "text": "People who are diagnosed with TB disease through screening should have nutrition screening and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        216.3986358642578,
        527.5419921875,
        230.8416290283203
      ],
      "text": "assessment. If malnutrition is identified, it should be managed according to WHO’s recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983187675476074,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.59864807128906,
        527.3826293945312,
        244.04164123535156
      ],
      "text": "on nutritional care and support for people with TB. Concerns about weight loss or failure to gain",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.79859924316406,
        527.4024658203125,
        257.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "weight should trigger further clinical assessment (e.g. to determine whether there is resistance to TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        527.4013061523438,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "drugs, poor adherence, comorbid conditions) and nutrition assessment in order to determine the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        266.40460205078125,
        233.27081298828125,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "(9) most appropriate interventions  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        290.902587890625,
        527.2415771484375,
        305.3456115722656
      ],
      "text": "Screening population groups at higher risk for TB is ethically sound as long as it designed and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        304.10247802734375,
        527.4387817382812,
        318.5455017089844
      ],
      "text": "conducted to improve individual and public health and wellbeing; in this way screening contributes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        317.302490234375,
        527.3981323242188,
        331.7455139160156
      ],
      "text": "to the common good and upholds the ethical principle of accountability. As such, screening should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        330.5025939941406,
        527.4552001953125,
        344.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "always be done with the intent to provide care to those who need it, and never to exclude entry or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        340.90850830078125,
        311.0019226074219,
        358.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "(10).  employment or discriminate against individuals",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.61248779296875,
        527.4105834960938,
        379.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "(10) Nevertheless, screening population groups primarily based on risk raises a range of ethical issues  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.979881286621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        378.60650634765625,
        527.3770751953125,
        393.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "First, most of the individuals offered screening will not have TB disease and are not contagious. This",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        391.8065185546875,
        527.5894165039062,
        406.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "makes the ethical obligations different from those associated with testing people who seek care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        405.0065002441406,
        527.5668334960938,
        419.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "because they are ill. For example, the absence of an immediate risk of transmission makes it unethical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990745544433594,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.2065124511719,
        527.42333984375,
        432.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "to restrict the movements of someone who has been offered screening. Refusal of screening should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.406494140625,
        527.421142578125,
        445.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "be respected and should not introduce discrimination of any sort. A screening programme should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        444.60650634765625,
        407.7037658691406,
        459.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "not create inequities in access to care for TB disease or any other reason.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.3103942871094,
        527.421142578125,
        480.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "Second, a positive screening test carries uncertainties, and confirmatory tests should be available",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.5104064941406,
        527.4300537109375,
        493.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "to ensure an effective diagnostic pathway. Informed consent requires effective communication with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        492.7104187011719,
        527.4223022460938,
        507.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "each person about these uncertainties (e.g. false-positive results, risk of overtreatment). Appropriate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        505.910400390625,
        527.4014892578125,
        520.3533935546875
      ],
      "text": "mechanisms to obtain informed consent should comply with international human rights standards",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        519.1104125976562,
        527.4521484375,
        533.5534057617188
      ],
      "text": "and account for different languages, literacy skills and legal status. Risk and uncertainty must be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.3104248046875,
        527.392578125,
        546.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "communicated in a way that is culturally and linguistically appropriate, including to those whose first",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        545.5103759765625,
        431.9862976074219,
        559.953369140625
      ],
      "text": "language is foreign to the local setting, children, as well as to people in prison.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        567.2142944335938,
        527.399169921875,
        581.6572875976562
      ],
      "text": "Third, TB disproportionately affects individuals and groups that are already disadvantaged due to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        580.4144287109375,
        527.420166015625,
        594.857421875
      ],
      "text": "disease, their socioeconomic situation or legal status, among other disadvantages. Therefore, efforts",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        593.6143798828125,
        527.4857177734375,
        608.057373046875
      ],
      "text": "must be made to address existing inequities in access to services and to uphold human rights, so that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986241340637207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        606.8143920898438,
        527.255126953125,
        621.2573852539062
      ],
      "text": "the vulnerability of targeted groups does not impede their access to screening and treatment or violate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.954757690429688,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        620.0142822265625,
        527.3981323242188,
        634.457275390625
      ],
      "text": "their rights. Any intervention for vulnerable groups – including migrants, prisoners and children –",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.2142944335938,
        527.3783569335938,
        647.6572875976562
      ],
      "text": "should include measures to minimize the risk of stigmatization. Testing positive on a screening test",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        646.4144287109375,
        527.4310913085938,
        660.857421875
      ],
      "text": "– as with a confirmed diagnosis of TB – should not influence an immigration procedure or be used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        659.6143798828125,
        527.4003295898438,
        674.057373046875
      ],
      "text": "to force migration or deny entry to a country. Screening done for migration or employment reasons",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        670.0203857421875,
        502.0726013183594,
        687.2573852539062
      ],
      "text": "(10) must uphold ethical principles; this should be reflected in laws or other policy regulations  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        691.7243041992188,
        527.4039306640625,
        708.9613037109375
      ],
      "text": "(11) People should be offered screening in strict adherence to human rights and ethical considerations  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.967752456665039,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.7183227539062,
        527.3880615234375,
        722.1613159179688
      ],
      "text": "Policies should be evaluated from an ethical perspective by those who use the guidelines, and the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        720.9183349609375,
        527.4443359375,
        735.361328125
      ],
      "text": "views and experiences of affected populations should be gathered after implementation, both to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        734.1182861328125,
        527.25048828125,
        748.561279296875
      ],
      "text": "consider possible unexpected effects and to ensure that the evidence on which they are based",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        744.5242919921875,
        527.4324340820312,
        761.7612915039062
      ],
      "text": "(12) remains current and relevant  . Person-centred care entails, among other considerations, that it",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.217041015625,
        136.43409729003906,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        796.217041015625,
        170.0604705810547,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        796.217041015625,
        226.65042114257812,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        49.47319793701172,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "12",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        805.8170166015625,
        219.03489685058594,
        816.3209838867188
      ],
      "text": "systematic screening for tuberculosis disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}